      "summary": "Source-bound model self-review of all changed relevant pi-swe source, tests, documentation, anatomy, and catalog found no blocking defects. The pending verification guard permits a fresh preparation to supersede an interrupted or stale pending observation while preserving exact-command binding. Runtime review recording requires an exited interactive_shell session, distinct reviewer and recorder session provenance, bounded current source, a matching contract fingerprint, explicit passing outcome, dimensions, and summary. Completion rejects missing, failed, stale, self-session, malformed, and launch-only evidence. New initiatives require independent review while readable legacy schema-version-1 authorities and commitOnWorkCompletion behavior remain compatible. Negative/runtime coverage and the full qualification command pass. This is a model self-review, not independent review.",
